STEP 4  Sensitivity of the c-mu rule to the follow-up weight T_follow
-------------------------------------------------------------------------
  T_follow is the only parameter we had to invent. If the conclusions moved with it, they would not be trustworthy -- so we sweep it.

  T_follow sweep             [##################################]   300/300   100.0%    3.7s elapsed,   0.0s left  

  Effect of T_follow (25 replications per setting)
  rule   T_follow (min)  W_total   W_L3   W_L4  follow-up wait  holding cost   SL4 %
  -----  --------------  -------  -----  -----  --------------  ------------  ------
  WSEPT              15    44.25   6.19  57.02            2.44        0.4077   86.00
  GCMU               15    44.35   8.69  56.31            3.82        0.4241   86.68
  WSEPT              30    44.32   3.77  57.94            3.48        0.3930   85.93
