VERDICT  Three lenses, because 'best' depends on the objective
------------------------------------------------------------------
  LENS 1  shortest unweighted mean wait  WSEPT   (42.32 min, SL4 86.9%) 
  LENS 2  lowest c-weighted holding cost WSEPT   (0.3763) 
  LENS 3  fastest policy that MEETS the SLA SBP*   (44.18 min, SL3 95.42%, SL4 95.64%) 

  These three answers differ, and that is the substantive result. The base paper reports a single winner because it evaluates a single metric on a system where its tuned thresholds happened to satisfy the constraint. On our rebuild the constraint bites, and the policy that minimises average waiting is not the policy a hospital could actually adopt.


